        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9023/102, Industrial Hanger 4 Inch Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLooking for a clean, contemporary kitchen cabinet pull that looks great and is made with attention to quality? The 4 Inch Hangar Door Pull is the answer. This industrial chic cabinet handle has a strong shape that is great for bold spaces. It is 4-1/4 inches long with a 4 inch center to center length. This Industrial Hanger 4 Inch Cabinet Handle comes with everything you'll need to install it on your cabinets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9023\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-203\"><b>8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/10-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9023 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sold Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
